OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Fsome outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle. Outbreaks of light rain and
OL,8,Fdrizzle are most likely in the east.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with a few
OL,13,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle.
OL,14,FAny rain mainly towards eastern coasts
OL,15,Fby the end of the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FThe east will be mostly cloudy
OL,18,Fwith some outbreaks of light rain and
OL,19,Fdrizzle possible. Further west will be
OL,20,Fdry with bright and sunny intervals
OL,21,Fdeveloping later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
